{
  "description": "WP3.0a natural-prevalence scan of cyclic missingness. Frozen 2026-08-26 before any Phase-3 run. Public datasets only (no auth-gated sources); eligibility per plan: variable subsets of size 3-6 with >= 4 realized patterns; cyclicity = Berge (frozen graham_acyclic). GO: cyclic realized pattern structure in >= 3 independent datasets OR >= 15% of eligible subsets pooled.",
